{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02341","headline":"杂歌谣辞 李夫人歌 三 · 李商隐","name":"杂歌谣辞 李夫人歌 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"蛮丝系条脱，妍眼和香屑。\n寿宫不惜铸南人，柔肠早被秋波割。\n清澄有余幽素香，鳏鱼渴凤真珠房。\n不知瘦骨类冰井，更许夜帘通晓霜。\n土花漠碧云[茫茫]，黄河欲尽天苍黄。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李商隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_02341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_02341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}